      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I arrived at 8:30pm one evening, without an appointment, interested in obtaining  a second opinion, regarding some expensive dental work recommended by a highly regarded dentist in Madrid. After a short wait, Preuzmite attended me and provided me with an honest, professional  opinion, that the work was not necessary at this moment, to keep watch on the condition.  I highly recommend this dentist. It's so rare to find honesty and such professionalism these days. Thank you! Michele",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
